{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-09-06 13:38:00', 'title': 'ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER CELEBRATES SAFETY MILESTONES IN TWO DISTRICTS', 'text': "BELLEVILLE, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER IS CELEBRATING TWO SIGNIFICANT SAFETY MILESTONES ACHIEVED BY THE STREATOR AND SOUTH BELOIT DISTRICTS. THE STREATOR DISTRICT CELEBRATED 14 YEARS AND THE SOUTH BELOIT DISTRICT CELEBRATED 16 YEARS ON AUG. 1, 2022. BERNIE SEBOLD, SENIOR MANAGER OF ILLINOIS AMERICAN WATER'S SAFETY AND HEALTH PROGRAM, SAID “THE STREATOR AND SOUTH BELOIT TEAMS HAVE MADE SAFETY THEIR PRIORITY, AND THEIR EFFORTS HAVE PREVENTED INCIDENTS AND HAZARDS. SAFETY IS EV"}